{"id":14117,"author":"chle_","body":"Chris_er_kul and Killerplayerhd\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eIt says that i ban evaded. But totally not!\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eStory:\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eMe and my friend Killerplayerhd (avicus.net/killerplayerhd) had a sleepover at nicolai156, which was already banned. We both brought our computer at his house. Then we started playing a little bit of Avicus. It must have\u0026nbsp;registered the network-ip we were in.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eThen one week later my friend Killerplayerhd was going to check his and my profile on this website, and found out that we both were banned.....\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003esooooo yeah............\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helv